WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.058
In Present, Space moves on.

2
00:00:04.158 --> 00:00:07.124
The left arrow goes back.

3
00:00:07.224 --> 00:00:13.897
Press a number to jump to that verse, C for the chorus, B for the bridge.

4
00:00:13.997 --> 00:00:17.023
The full stop blanks the screen.

5
00:00:17.123 --> 00:00:21.022
Your speaker notes stay on your screen, never the congregation's.
